{"id":"n48799-1-7","stage":3,"title":"등산복 · 登山服","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48799-1-7-1","ko":"산에 오를 때 아무 옷이나 입으면 안 되나요?","zh":"爬山的时候随便穿点衣服不行吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"산에","meaning":"山","explanation":"산：山；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20954","senseId":"1","lemma":"산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오를","meaning":"上，登，攀登","explanation":"오르다：上，登，攀登；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"오르다","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69518","senseId":"1","lemma":"오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아무","meaning":"任何，什么","explanation":"아무：任何，什么","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷이나","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입으면","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되나요?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab367eb9a60ab986","term":"산","zh":"山","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3","entryId":"20954","definition":"比平地高耸出很多，大多有着树木、草、石头等的土地。","pronunciation":["산"]},{"id":"8fdeb9822b3fa061","term":"오르다","zh":"上，登，攀登","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3","entryId":"69518","definition":"人、动物等从低的地方移动到高的地方或从下往上移动。","pronunciation":["오르다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"1bb289b6e5d9e641","term":"아무","zh":"任何，什么","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3","entryId":"71327","definition":"用于指不特定的某人或某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/31c734653dc536f05d96.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48799-1-7-2","ko":"아무래도 등산복이 편하긴 하지요.","zh":"毕竟穿登山服会更舒服些吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아무래도","meaning":"到底，还是","explanation":"아무래도：到底，还是","readings":[{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71330","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"등산복이","meaning":"登山服","explanation":"등산복：登山服；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"등산복","audio":"/audio/f4ea3eb268adae2700f5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48799","senseId":"1","lemma":"등산복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편하긴","meaning":"舒服，舒畅","explanation":"편하다：舒服，舒畅；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"편하다","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71334","senseId":"1","lemma":"편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지요.","meaning":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f5dbee1c946c5e6b","term":"아무래도","zh":"到底，还是","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3","entryId":"71330","definition":"不管怎么想；或指不管怎么做。","pronunciation":["아ː무래도"]},{"id":"f4ea3eb268adae27","term":"등산복","zh":"登山服","audio":"/audio/f4ea3eb268adae2700f5.mp3","entryId":"48799","definition":"登山时穿的衣服。","pronunciation":["등산복"]},{"id":"33bf1e37d2739b22","term":"편하다","zh":"舒服，舒畅","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3","entryId":"71334","definition":"身体或心情不难受，好。","pronunciation":["편하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62899","definition":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/571cbb551e1d9eb5f3b4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.637,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=48799","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":91,"sequenceScore":2.4637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["毕竟穿登山服会更舒服些吧。","爬山的时候随便穿点衣服不行吗？","这些家具的设计各不相同，所以搭配在一起不协调。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["爬山的时候随便穿点衣服不行吗？","这些家具的设计各不相同，所以搭配在一起不协调。","毕竟穿登山服会更舒服些吧。"],"answer":2}]}
